{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y的高亮短语能串出靠近、收住、被看见、害怕失去、接受不确定这一连贯变化，X的大块虽然信息完整，但部分表达偏抽象。small：Y的补充更多提供关系细节和身体体验，X的小字有几处直接复述大字，例如话到嘴边不敢说、反复确认等。core：Y始终把亲密带来的幸福与害怕失去这份亲近的痛楚连在一起，具体关系和情感因果也更清楚。concise：X反复使用确认、回味、留住、时间流逝等意思，大字小字之间也有重复；Y的情节推进带来了更多新信息。human：Y整体更接近日常说话，虽然“露出在意”“忘了藏好喜欢”略显别扭，但X的“放松安排和控制”“把表达压低一些”“温和而清楚的收束”更有抽象摘要腔。fine：Y有“还没分开就先有一点舍不得”“心口发疼”等具体体验，X的船、水、漂浮意象较多且重复，部分感受也比较概括。load：X每屏往往有多条较长的大块，Y只需扫读高亮短语就能抓住主要变化，更适合给定的停留时间。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "324e91c7-0847-4be0-bd0b-f3f66fb3a79e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T131529607132Z", "elapsed_seconds": 334.546, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T13:21:04.170773+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4d4a2468d7022277f87a615f2af5406ab1bf0b41b07fd2c44d2f9c0f447bf7b9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96